sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant Sockets as Realtime Gateway

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/devices/:deviceId/revoke
    API->>DB: Update device status = 'REVOKED' & Purge Public Prekeys
    API->>Redis: Invalidate Refresh Token & Access Token Hashes
    API->>Sockets: Push Device Revocation Socket Event
    Sockets->>User: Force Disconnect WebSocket Connection
